      "seed": 49209516,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1783314826,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Limitations\n− Hardware is expensive: big models need big GPUs\n− You run ops: batching, scaling, monitoring, patches\n− Some models weaker at hard reasoning / tool use\n− Licences still apply, read them per model\n− Outages and regressions are your problem",
      "originalText": "Limitations\n− Hardware is expensive: big models need big GPUs\n− You run ops: batching, scaling, monitoring, patches\n− Some models weaker at hard reasoning / tool use\n− Licences still apply, read them per model\n− Outages and regressions are your problem",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
